# The umarell of the public sample: its install clones this commit of the public umarell repository
# (aws-samples/sample-industrial-multi-robot-agents) from this URL, and applies the cell planner's upstream fixes for it
# on top (cell-planner/docs/upstream/patches_<first 7 hex digits>/series.txt). FactoryOS's internal servers don't read
# this file: they keep installing their own commit from their pinned archives (deploy/umarell-base.txt, and
# deploy/umarell.txt with the fixes applied); the public commit is a published copy of it. The export pipeline
# (ci/public-export/export.sh) fetches this commit and checks that its fix series applies.
#
# <commit, 40 hex digits>  <git URL>
